<Layout title="Disclaimer" description="Website disclaimer for Ankit Jobs & Staffing India — no employment guarantee, vacancy availability, representative imagery and how to confirm details.">
  <PageHero title="Information You Can Put in Context." crumb="Disclaimer" eyebrow="Website disclaimer" text="Please read this before relying on information on this website."/>
  <section class="section"><article class="container legal-content"><h2>No employment guarantee</h2><p>A website visit, enquiry or registration does not guarantee employment, an interview or a particular outcome. Opportunities depend on genuine vacancy availability, role requirements and employer selection.</p><h2>Services and process</h2><p>Service descriptions and the How It Works steps explain how Ankit Jobs &amp; Staffing India generally works. Individual steps can differ depending on the role and each employer’s requirements.</p><h2>Current vacancies</h2><p>Vacancies shown on the <a href="/current-openings/">Current Openings</a> page are based on information from hiring companies. Salaries, locations, eligibility and availability can change or close without notice. Confirm the details with the team before you apply or travel.</p><h2>Representative imagery</h2><p>Workforce and recruitment photographs are AI-generated illustrations of professional situations. They do not depict actual staff, clients, successful candidates or confirmed vacancies. The company logo is the original artwork of Ankit Jobs &amp; Staffing India.</p><h2>Online forms</h2><p>Details you submit through the Candidate Zone and Recruiter Zone forms are handled as described in the <a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a>.</p><h2>Confirm the details</h2><p>Speak with <a href="/contact-us/">the team</a> to confirm current service availability, vacancy information and applicable terms.</p></article></section>
</Layout>
